  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : (24 + 14 - 6) ÷ 2 + 18 × 3 - 20 = 40\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers :\n\nOption 1) 20 and 14\n\n(24 + 14 - 6) ÷ 2 + 18 × 3 - 20 = 40 ⇒ (24 + 20 - 6) ÷ 2 + 18 × 3 - 14 = 40\n\n⇒ __**(24 + 20 - 6)**__ ÷ 2 + 18 × 3 - 14 = 40\n\n⇒ __**(44 - 6)**__ ÷ 2 + 18 × 3 - 14 = 40\n\n⇒ __**38**____** ÷ 2**__ + 18 × 3 - 14 = 40\n\n⇒ 19 + __**18 × 3**__ - 14 = 40\n\n⇒ __**19 + 54**__ - 14 = 40\n\n⇒ __73** - 14**__ = 40\n\n⇒ 59 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 2 and 3\n\n(24 + 14 - 6) ÷ 2 + 18 × 3 - 20 = 40 ⇒ (24 + 14 - 6) ÷ 3 + 18 × 2 - 20 = 40\n\n⇒ __**(24 + 14 - 6)**__ ÷ 3 + 18 × 2 - 20 = 40\n\n⇒ __**(38 - 6)**__ ÷ 3 + 18 × 2 - 20 = 40\n\n⇒ __**32 ÷ 3**__ + 18 × 2 - 20 = 40\n\n⇒ 10.67 + __**18 × 2**__ - 20 = 40\n\n⇒ __**10.67 + **36__ - 20 = 40\n\n⇒ __46.67** - 20**__ = 40\n\n⇒26.67 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 20 and 24\n\n(24 + 14 - 6) ÷ 2 + 18 × 3 - 20 = 40 ⇒ (20 + 14 - 6) ÷ 2 + 18 × 3 - 24 = 40\n\n⇒ __**(20 + 14 - 6)**__ ÷ 2 + 18 × 3 - 24 = 40\n\n⇒ __**(34 - 6)**__ ÷ 2 + 18 × 3 - 24 = 40\n\n⇒ __**28 ÷ 2**__ + 18 × 3 - 24 = 40\n\n⇒ 14 + __**18 × 3**__ - 24 = 40\n\n⇒ __**14 + **54__ - 24 = 40\n\n⇒ __**68**____** - 24**__ = 40\n\n⇒ 44 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 14 and 18\n\n(24 + 14 - 6) ÷ 2 + 18 × 3 - 20 = 40 ⇒ (24 + 18 - 6) ÷ 2 + 14 × 3 - 20 = 40\n\n⇒ __**(24 + 18 - 6)**__ ÷ 2 + 14 × 3 - 20 = 40\n\n⇒ __**(42 - 6)**__ ÷ 2 + 14 × 3 - 20 = 40\n\n⇒ __**36 ÷ 2**__ + 14 × 3 - 20 = 40\n\n⇒ 18 + __**14 × 3**__ - 20 = 40\n\n⇒ __**18 + **42__ - 20 = 40\n\n⇒ __**60**____** - 20**__ = 40\n\n⇒ 40 = 40 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
